DAILY_Lucid_InfoTab '= @"「\@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:7 && DAILY_Lucid_Stats:6 <= 0 ? 안정화까지의 시간: {DAILY_Lucid_Stats:7} #  \@\@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:6 > 0 ? 수리까지의 시간: {DAILY_Lucid_Stats:6}분 #  \@」"
RETURNF DAILY_Lucid_InfoTab
